  "name": "Capitulation Fade",
  "description": "On the NBA moneyline: when a team has missed 6 or more threes in the current quarter, is down by 10 or more points, and its price is under 40 cents, buy the other team at half max size. While holding: if the held side rises above 80 cents, sell the position to lock in the profit and stop. If it falls below 30 cents instead, dump it and buy the original team in one order (the unified book flips the position). The exits apply to whichever side is currently held.",
